  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the following statements:<br /><br />P: Suman is brilliant<br /><br />Q: Suman is rich<br /><br />R: Suman is honest<br /><br />The negation of the statement, &quot;Suman is brilliant and dishonest if and only if Suman is rich&quot; can be equivalently expressed as"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mo>~</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>↔</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>R</mi></math>",
